plan error: AnalyzerError: Unsupported pattern: composite join has two column sets that are the same set of names in DIFFERENT order (FkEdgeJoin Right: ["region", "forum_id"] vs ["forum_id", "region"]). The join pairs columns positionally, so this would silently cross them (e.g. `region = forum_id AND forum_id = region`) and return wrong rows. Declare the join columns (edge FK / node id) in the SAME order on both sides. (#672/#1010)